  "question": {
    "text": "Two satellites of masses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;revolve around the earth in circular orbits of radii <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> respectively. The ratio of orbital speeds of the satellites respectively is",
    "image": null
  },
